Section: 1. INTRODUCTION
Text: 1. INTRODUCTION Sentiment analysis is a task that aims at recognizing in text the opinion of the writer. It is often modeled as a classiﬁ- cation problem which relies on features extracted from the text in order to feed a classiﬁer.

